        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="text_36" value="&lt;div&gt;hub_menu_item is the Hub–MenuItem association class; its composite PK is (hub_id, menu_item_id).&lt;br/&gt;UNIQUE: menu_item(brand_id, name); hub_menu_item(hub_id, menu_item_id) PK; brand.name and voucher.code.&lt;br/&gt;An absent hub_menu_item row is unlisted; is_available is per hub. Order snapshots retain historical names/prices.&lt;br/&gt;Continuation: Hub resolves to PartA; orders/lines continue in PartC; payment/delivery and replacement offers in PartsD/E.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#202B36;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
